===Alternative forms===
* {{q|abbreviation}}: {{l|en|Ru.}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|ML.|-}} (11th century) {{m|la|Russiānus}}, the adjective of {{m|la|Russia}}, a Latinization of the {{der|en|orv|Русь}}. Attested in English (both as a noun and as an adjective) from the 16th century. {{surf|en|Russia|-an}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɹʌʃ(ə)n/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-Russian.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|ʌʃən|s=2}}

